       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Interactions (all diuretics):"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " lithium—⍉, diuretics cut its clearance & risk toxicity; NSAIDs can blunt the diuretic & antiHTN effect of loop · K-sparing and thiazide diuretics"
     }
